TEXT 816 400 Left 2 ;Load: open (1 MEG) to 0.2 ms, log ramp to 0.1 ohm by 2.2 ms,\nshort held to 3.2 ms, then snapped back open to watch recovery.\nop-amp Ilimit fixed at 65m (OPA2197 typ). Joint R_B / R_sense sizing:\ntarget <= 65 mA LOAD current in a hard short.\nvin 3.0 = 10 V setpoint; 3.3 = DAC full scale, 11 V at fb (the 50 mA spec corner).
